01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:26,000
Back to the Outback is a 2021 animated family film that follows a group of misunderstood
Australian animals who escape from the zoo to find acceptance and freedom in the Outback.

11
01:07:28,000 --> 01:07:34,000
It is directed by Clare Knight and Harry Cripps (in their feature directorial debuts), from
a screenplay written by Cripps, and a story by Cripps and Gregory Lessans.

12
01:13:36,000 --> 01:13:42,000
The voice cast includes Isla Fisher, Tim Minchin, Eric Bana, Guy Pearce, Miranda Tapsell, Angus
Imrie, Keith Urban, and Jacki Weaver, and is distributed by Netflix Animation.

13
01:19:44,000 --> 01:19:50,000
The film had a limited theatrical release on December 3, 2021, prior to streaming on Netflix
on December 10, to a generally positive reception from critics and audiences.

14
01:25:52,000 --> 01:25:58,000
The tone is lighthearted.
